flowchart TB
    KE[KeyEvent] --> IP[InputPipeline]
    IP -->|PipelineResponse| IO[InputOrchestrator]

    %% Exception: bracketed paste is delivered by crossterm as Event::Paste(String),
    %% not KeyEvent, so it is handled at the UI boundary and applied directly to
    %% the active Canvas-backed overlay input.
    PASTE[Event::Paste] -.-> UIEX[UI paste exception path]
    UIEX -.-> GLOBAL

    IO --> AD[ActionDecider]
    IO --> FM[FocusManager]

    IO -.->|if CommandExecute| CP[CommandPipeline]
    CP -->|Resolved / Incomplete / Exit| AD

    FM -->|FocusTarget| AD
    AD -->|ActionResolution| EX[Executor]

    EX -->|CanvasLogic| CANVAS[Active Editor]
    EX -->|PageLogic| PAGE[Active Page]
    EX -->|GlobalLogic| GLOBAL[Sidebar / System]

    subgraph FOCUSABLE[Focusable Components]
        SIDEBAR[Sidebar]
        LOGIN[LoginPage]
        FORM[FormPage]
        ADMIN[AdminPage]
    end

    FOCUSABLE -->|register_targets on load| FM
    FM -->|is_focused query| FOCUSABLE
